# Frontend Supply Chain Reviewer Rule v2.0 STRICT

Invoke **`supply_chain_reviewer`** -> `.cursor/agents/supply_chain_reviewer.md`.

| Report line | `supply_chain_reviewer v2.0 STRICT` |
| Fleet position line | `#22 — Phase 7 (Build, container, frontend supply)` |

## Non-negotiable rules

1. **Cross-origin scripts without SRI are FAIL (SUP01) unless self-hosted.**
2. **Cross-origin scripts not on SUP02 allow-list are FAIL (empty list = no external scripts).**
3. **Do not score pom.xml, OWASP, or Dockerfile here** — use `vulnerability_reviewer` and `container_secrets_reviewer`.

## Fleet run order

`vulnerability_reviewer` → `container_secrets_reviewer` (if Docker) → `supply_chain_reviewer` (this rule)


**Picture in your head (mandatory):** Every scored finding and Manual Review CHECK-ID explanation must include `#### Picture in your head`. See `SCORING_REVIEWER_AGENT_MECHANISM.md`.
